# In new syntax, bare identifiers are var refs. $-prefix in head position prevents call.
[$name has? my-var _private get-or]
=== out
[name  has?  my-var  _private  get-or]

=== warn
[UndefinedVariable] undefined variable: name
[UndefinedVariable] undefined variable: my-var
[UndefinedVariable] undefined variable: _private
